# kungfu is a Nix-built, Nix-managed package here — `kungfu update` self-
# replacing the running binary conflicts with that immutability (the Nix
# store and this repo's own record of "what's installed" would silently
# diverge from the actual binary on disk). Not an upstream bug — this
# repo's own packaging decision — so no upstream issue and this patch is
# never meant to land upstream or be dropped; update kungfu here by
# bumping the rev in package.nix next to this patch.
--- a/crates/kungfu-cli/src/commands.rs
+++ b/crates/kungfu-cli/src/commands.rs
@@ -2556,84 +2556,14 @@
         .update
 }
 
-/// `kungfu update` — check for and install a new release.
+/// `kungfu update` — disabled in this build.
